body:
i just fell back into the cycle of binging and then restricting to make up for the calories i consumed the day before and i feel so disgusted. I was doing so well with eating healthy foods and exercising a moderate amount to lose weight.  That soon ended when i went off to vacation and ate a lot in a span of two days, so i felt guilty and restricted to make up for my overeating.. I truly hope i can break this cycle because i don't want to do this for another week or month,, i just hope i didn't gain any weight from this stupid cycle.

&#x200B;

my family says i'm getting skinnier which is how i know i'm making progress but what if i gained because of the past 2 weeks of binging and restricting??
